      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 5 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (4) by deleting the words \", subject to section 6,\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (4) the following subsections: \"(4A) No application for a licence under this section shall be considered unless the prescribed fees have been paid to the Controller. (4B) There shall be charged and paid to the Controller on the grant of a licence and at such intervals after such grant during the period of validity of the licence such fees as may be prescribed.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_10__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (5), by substituting for the word \"aforesaid\" the words \"imposed under subsection (4)\". Amendment of section 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11",
