      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (c), by deleting the word \"and\" appearing at the end of the paragraph;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11__para_a__subpara_iv",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iv",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11__para_a__subpara_iv__subpara_C",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (d) — (A) by inserting after the word \"secretary\" the words \"of the applicant\"; (B) by inserting after the word \"treasurer\" the words \"of the applicant\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11__para_a__subpara_iv__subpara_C",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "C",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11__para_a__subpara_iv",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the full stop appearing at the end of the paragraph a semicolon; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11__para_a__subpara_v",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "v",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (d) the following paragraphs: \"(e) unless, at the time the application is made, the applicant or any member or partner of the applicant, if the applicant is a body of persons or firm, or a director, manager or secretary of the applicant, if the applicant is a company, has not, due to a conviction for an offence under this Act, been sentenced to a fine exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment (other than imprisonment in default of a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit); (Amendment) (f) unless, at the time the application is made, a person who had been a director of or had been directly concerned in the management of the business of a licensed housing developer which has been wound up by a court is not a director or is not directly concerned in the management of the business of the applicant; and (g) if the registration of the applicant's architect or engineer has been cancelled and has not been reinstated under the Architects Act 1967 [Act 117] or the Registration of Engineers Act 1967 [Act 138] at the time the application is made.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1A) For the purposes of paragraphs ( 1 ) ( d ) , ( e) and (f), if the applicant is a company, the expression \"applicant\" shall include the holding company of the applicant, or a subsidiary of the applicant or a subsidiary of the holding company of the applicant.\". New section 6A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 6 the following section: \"Controller to keep deposit 6A. Subject to any direction of the Minister, the Controller shall keep the deposit made under paragraphs 6(1 )(a) and (b) until the expiry of the defect liability period of the housing development. Controller may forfeit deposit 6B. If any licensed holding developer— (a) is carrying on his business, in the opinion of the Controller, in a manner detrimental to the interest of the purchasers or to any member of the public; (b) has insufficient assets to cover his liabilities; (c) is contravening any of the provisions of this Act; or (d) has ceased to carry on housing development in West Malaysia, the Controller may, after having given the licensed developer an opportunity to submit reasons within a specified time on why the deposit under paragraph 6(1)(a) or (b) should not be forfeited, forfeit the whole or a part of the deposit.'. New Part III"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting before section 7 the following heading: \"PART III DUTIES OF A LICENSED HOUSING DEVELOPER\". Amendment of section 7"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
