    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_28__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting paragraph (b);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_28__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the word \"ten\" the word \"fifty\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_28__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words \"a further fine of\" the words \"a further fine not exceeding\". Amendment of section 20"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 20 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word \"ten\" the word \"fifty\". Amendment of section 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Housing Developers (Control and Licensing) Act 1966 [Act 118], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended by inserting before section 1 the following heading: \"PART I PRELIMINARY\". Amendment of section 1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 21 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word \"ten\" the word \"fifty\". (Amendment) Amendment of section 22"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 22(1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word \"ten\" the word \"fifty\". New sections 22A, 22B and 22c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_32__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_32__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_32__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 22 the following sections: \"Public servants and public officers 22A. The Controller, every Deputy Controller, every Inspector and all members and officers of the Tribunal shall be deemed to be public servants for the purposes of the Penal Code [Act 574], and to be public officers for the purposes of the Criminal Procedure Code or any other written law which the Minister may from time to time prescribe. Application of Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 22B. The Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 [Act 198] shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceedings against the Minister, Controller, any Deputy Controller, any Inspector, the Tribunal or any member or officer of the Tribunal in respect of any act, neglect or default done or committed by him in such capacity. Right to initiate and maintain actions 22c. Notwithstanding anything contained in any written law or any rule of law, a homebuyer as defined in section 16A shall be entitled on his own volition and in his own name to initiate, commence, institute and maintain in any court or tribunal any action, suit or proceeding against a housing developer or any other person in respect of any matter arising out of the sale and purchase agreement entered into between the purchaser and that housing developer unless a contrary intention is expressed in any agreement, assignment or charge between the homebuyer and his financier in which case the prior written consent of his financier must first be obtained before he exercises any of his rights under this section.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_32__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_32",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every agreement, assignment or charge lawfully entered into between a purchaser and his financier before the appointed date shall be subject to, and the parties thereto shall be entitled to the benefits of, the new section 22c of the principal Act as inserted into the principal Act by subsection (1). New section 23A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_33",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "33",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 23 the following section: \"Power to compound 23A. (1) The Controller may compound any offence against this Act or any regulations made under this Act which has been prescribed under paragraph 24(2)(i) to be a compoundable offence by collecting from the person reasonably suspected of having committed the offence a sum of money not exceeding the maximum fine prescribed for that offence. (2) Where an offence has been compounded under subsection (1), no prosecution shall thereafter be instituted in respect of the compounded offence. (3) Any moneys paid to the Controller under this section shall be paid into and form part of the Consolidated Fund.\". Amendment of section 24"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "34",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 24(2) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (f) the following paragraph: \"(f) prescribe the fees which are payable under this Act;\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the word \"and\" at the end of paragraph (g);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the full stop at the end of paragraph (h) a semicolon; and (Amendment)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_34",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (h) the following paragraphs: \"(i) prescribe offences which may be compounded and the forms to be used in and the method and the procedure for compounding such offences; and (j) provide for any matter which under this Act is required or permitted to be prescribed or which is necessary or expedient to be prescribed to give effect to this Act.\". Savings and transitional"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "35",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The provisions of the principal Act as amended by this Act, except Part VI and sections 22, 23 and 24 in so far as they relate to an offence under section 16AD of the principal Act, shall not apply to any housing development engaged in, carried on, undertaken or caused to be undertaken under the principal Act by-"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a society registered or incorporated under any written law relating to co-operative societies; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any body or agency established and incorporated by statute and under the control of the Federal Government or the Government of any State, as the case may be, if housing accommodation had been offered for sale."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purpose of subsection (1), the term \"licensed housing developer\" in Part VI of the principal Act shall be deemed to include a society, body or agency referred to in that subsection."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any such society, body or agency as is referred to in paragraphs (1)(a) and (b) engaged in, carrying on, undertaking or causing to be undertaken any housing development where housing accommodation had not been offered for sale before the appointed date shall, not later than six months from the appointed date, apply to the Controller for a licence under the principal Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pending the decision by the Controller on the application for a licence made under subsection (3), the applicant shall be deemed to be licensed under this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 1 (1) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the word \"Developers\" the word \"Development\". Reference to the principal Act"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where, on and after the appointed date, a reference is made in any written law to the \"Housing Developers (Control and Licensing) Act 1966\", such reference shall be construed as a reference to the \"Housing Development (Control and Licensing) Act 1966\". Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 2(1) of the principal Act is deleted. Amendment of section 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_g",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_h",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_j"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 3 of the principal Act is amended —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of \"bank\", by substituting for the words \"Banking Act 1973 [Act 102]\" the words \"Banking and Financial Institutions Act 1989 [Act 372]\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"body of persons\" the following definition: ' \"certificate of fitness for occupation\" means the certificate of fitness for occupation given or granted under the Street, Drainage and Building Act 1974 [Act 133] and any by-laws made under that Act;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"Controller\" the following definition: ' \"Deputy Controller\" means the Deputy Controller of Housing appointed under section 4;'; (Amendment)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of \"finance company\", by substituting for the words \"Finance Companies Act 1969 [Act 6]\" the words \"Banking and Financial Institutions Act 1989\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of \"housing accommodation\", by inserting after the words \"for business premises\" the words \"but does not include an accommodation erected on any land designated for or approved for commercial development\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of \"licensed housing developer\", by inserting after the words \"housing development\" the words \"and includes the holder of any power of attorney of such housing developer duly created under the Powers of Attorney Act 1949 [Act 424]\" ;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_g",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "g",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"licensed housing developer\" the following definition: ' \"local authority\" includes any person or body of persons appointed or authorized under any written law to exercise and perform the powers and duties which are conferred and imposed on a local authority under any written law;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_h",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "h",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the definition of \"prescribed\" the following definition: ' \"prescribed\" means prescribed by regulations made under this Act, and where no mode is mentioned means prescribed from time to time by order published in the Gazette;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_i",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the definition of \"purchaser\" the following definition: ' \"purchaser\" means any person who purchases housing accommodation or who has any dealing with a licensed housing developer in respect of the acquisition of housing accommodation;'; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7__para_j",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "j",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"purchaser\" the following definitions: ' \"stakeholder\" means any solicitor holding moneys as stakeholder for payment to a housing developer pursuant to sale and purchase agreements in respect of a housing development which the housing developer is engaged in, carries on or undertakes or causes to be undertaken; \"Tribunal\" means the Tribunal for Homebuyer Claims established under section 16B.'. Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 4 the following section: \"Appointment of Controller, Deputy Controllers, Inspectors and other officers and servants 4. (1) For the purpose of this Act, the Minister may appoint a Controller of Housing and such number of Deputy Controllers of Housing, Inspectors of Housing and other officers and servants as the Minister may deem fit from amongst members of the public service. (2) The Controller and Deputy Controllers shall have and may exercise any of the powers conferred on an Inspector by or under this Act. (3) The Controller may, in writing, delegate all or any of his powers or functions under this Act, except his power of delegation, to any Deputy Controller, Inspector, officer or servant appointed under subsection (1). (4) Without prejudice to subsection (2), the Controller may, in writing, delegate any of his powers and functions under this Act in respect of the investigation of offences under this Act and the enforcement of this Act to any public officer or officer of a local authority. (Amendment) (5) Any delegation under subsection (3) or (4) may be revoked at any time by the Controller and does not prohibit the Controller from himself exercising the powers or performing the functions so delegated.\". New Part II"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/36/eng@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
